WEBVTT

00:08.008 --> 00:09.377
- ARE YOU READY, KIDS?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:09.377 --> 00:11.179
all: AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN!
所有人：是，是，队长！

00:11.179 --> 00:12.613
- I CAN'T HEAR YOU.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:12.613 --> 00:14.582
all: AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN!
所有人：是，是，队长！

00:14.582 --> 00:17.585
- * OHH...
-*哦...

00:17.585 --> 00:19.853
* WHO LIVES IN A PINEAPPLE
UNDER THE SEA? *
*谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ *

00:19.853 --> 00:21.855
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:21.855 --> 00:23.824
- * ABSORBENT AND YELLOW
AND POROUS IS HE *
- * 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的*

00:23.824 --> 00:25.559
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:25.559 --> 00:27.895
- * IF NAUTICAL NONSENSE
BE SOMETHING YOU WISH *
- * 如果是航海废话
成为您所希望的*

00:27.895 --> 00:29.430
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:29.430 --> 00:31.832
- * THEN DROP ON THE DECK
AND FLOP LIKE A FISH *
- * 然后掉到甲板上
像鱼一样扑腾*

00:31.832 --> 00:33.834
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
- READY?
所有：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:33.834 --> 00:35.869
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:35.869 --> 00:37.771
SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
海绵宝宝！

00:37.771 --> 00:39.773
SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
海绵宝宝！

00:39.773 --> 00:41.008
- * SPONGEBOB
- * 海绵宝宝

00:41.008 --> 00:43.244
* SQUAREPANTS!
* 方裤！

00:43.244 --> 00:45.713
[laughing]
[笑]

00:45.713 --> 00:48.048
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

00:48.048 --> 00:48.982
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

00:52.052 --> 00:55.055
[suspenseful orchestral music]
【悬疑的管弦乐】

00:55.055 --> 01:00.894
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

01:00.894 --> 01:01.895
[bubbling]
[冒泡]

01:01.895 --> 01:05.166
[whimsical music]
[异想天开的音乐]

01:05.166 --> 01:06.634
- HI, SQUIDWARD.
- 嗨，章鱼哥。

01:06.634 --> 01:08.369
BET YOU CAN'T GUESS
WHAT MOVIE WE'RE GONNA SEE.
打赌你猜不到
我们要看什么电影。

01:08.369 --> 01:09.703
- [slurping]
- [发出声音]

01:09.703 --> 01:11.038
- THAT'S OKAY!
I'LL TELL YOU.
- 没关系！
我会告诉你。

01:11.038 --> 01:12.273
- [slurping]
- [发出声音]

01:12.273 --> 01:15.943
- IT'S FISHER--
- [continues slurping]
- 这是费舍尔--
- [继续吸吮]

01:15.943 --> 01:17.178
[smacks lips]
[咂嘴]

01:17.178 --> 01:18.212
AHH.
啊啊。

01:18.212 --> 01:20.047
YOU MAY SPEAK.
你可以说话。

01:20.047 --> 01:21.249
- [inhales]
- [吸气]

01:21.249 --> 01:23.784
PATRICK AND I
ARE GONNA SEE FISHERMAN 4.
帕特里克和我
我们要去看《渔夫 4》了。

01:23.784 --> 01:26.320
- HA! YOU TWO WON'T SLEEP
A WINK TONIGHT
- 哈！你们两个不睡觉
今晚眨眼

01:26.320 --> 01:28.256
IF YOU SEE THAT MOVIE.
如果你看到那部电影。

01:28.256 --> 01:32.293
- SQUIDWARD, YOU ARE LOOKING
AT TWO VERY GROWN-UP BIG BOYS.
- 章鱼哥，你在看
两个已经长大的大男孩。

01:32.293 --> 01:34.027
- YEAH.
NOTHING CAN SCARE US.
- 是的。
没有什么可以吓倒我们。

01:34.027 --> 01:35.028
- BOO.
- 嘘。

01:35.028 --> 01:36.029
[both scream]
[两人尖叫]

01:36.029 --> 01:37.898
[laughs]
[笑]

01:37.898 --> 01:39.167
[slurps]
[啜饮]

01:39.167 --> 01:40.368
[both screaming]
[两人尖叫]

01:40.368 --> 01:44.172
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

01:44.172 --> 01:46.340
- [clears throat]
WE'LL SHOW SQUIDWARD.
- [清喉咙]
我们将展示《章鱼哥》。

01:46.340 --> 01:48.876
WE'RE NOT AFRAID
OF ANY OLD MOVIE.
我们不害怕
任何老电影的。

01:50.578 --> 01:51.845
both: WHOA!
两人：哇！

01:51.845 --> 01:55.183
- WE'RE LOST.
- I WISH WE HAD A FLASHLIGHT.
- 我们迷路了。
- 我希望我们有一个手电筒。

01:55.183 --> 01:57.851
- TAKE YOUR SEATS.
- 就座。

01:57.851 --> 01:59.387
[both scream]
[两人尖叫]

01:59.387 --> 02:00.921
- SEATS TAKEN, SIR.
- 已就座，先生。

02:00.921 --> 02:02.856
OOH, THE MOVIE'S STARTING.
哦，电影开始了。

02:02.856 --> 02:05.859
[exciting orchestral music]
【激动人心的管弦乐】

02:05.859 --> 02:08.662
**
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

02:08.662 --> 02:10.198
[both scream]
[两人尖叫]

02:10.198 --> 02:11.532
- SHH!
- SORRY.
- 嘘！
- 对不起。

02:11.532 --> 02:13.501
[laughter]
[笑声]

02:13.501 --> 02:14.968
SO THIS ISN'T TOO SCARY.
所以这并不太可怕。

02:14.968 --> 02:17.871
[laughter]
[笑声]

02:17.871 --> 02:19.373
THE FISHERMAN'S HOOK.
渔夫的钩子。

02:19.373 --> 02:22.243
GET OFF THE TEETER-TOTTER!
- YOU FOOLS.
摆脱跷跷板！
-你们这些傻瓜。

02:22.243 --> 02:23.877
- [laughing]
- [笑]

02:23.877 --> 02:25.213
[gags, screams]
[堵嘴，尖叫]

02:25.213 --> 02:26.480
[both scream]
[两人尖叫]

02:26.480 --> 02:27.681
- THE FISHERMAN'S GOT HIM.
- 渔夫抓住了他。

02:27.681 --> 02:29.583
- AND HE'LL FRY THEM
INTO FISH STICKS.
- 他会油炸它们
成鱼条。

02:29.583 --> 02:32.220
I CAN'T WATCH.
IS THE SCARY PART OVER?
我看不了。
可怕的部分结束了吗？

02:32.220 --> 02:34.222
- UH, HOLD ON.
I'LL TAKE A PEEK.
- 呃，等等。
我来看看。

02:34.222 --> 02:36.290
- THANK YOU FOR MEETING ME,
EDWINA...
- 谢谢你见到我，
埃德温娜……

02:36.290 --> 02:38.226
AT MIDNIGHT.
午夜。

02:38.226 --> 02:40.394
- PATRICK, IT'S OKAY.
- 帕特里克，没关系。

02:40.394 --> 02:41.395
- YOU SURE?
- 你确定吗？

02:41.395 --> 02:42.663
[screams]
IT'S WORSE!
[尖叫声]
更糟的是！

02:42.663 --> 02:44.232
THEY'RE KISSING!
他们正在接吻！

02:44.232 --> 02:46.500
[both smooching]
[两人接吻]

02:46.500 --> 02:48.336
- I LOVE YOU, SUZIE.
- 我爱你，苏西。

02:48.336 --> 02:49.837
- IT'S JENNIFER.
- 这是詹妮弗。

02:49.837 --> 02:53.307
- I'LL NEVER LEAVE YOU,
JENNIFER.
- 我永远不会离开你，
詹妮弗。

02:53.307 --> 02:56.344
GOOD-BYE, MARGARET!
再见，玛格丽特！

02:56.344 --> 02:58.946
both: THE FISHERMAN!
两人：渔夫！

02:58.946 --> 03:00.514
- AH!
- HEY!
- 啊！
- 嘿！

03:00.514 --> 03:01.782
[all shouting angrily]
[大家愤怒地喊叫]

03:01.782 --> 03:04.918
- UH, SORRY, SORRY, SORRY.
- 呃，对不起，对不起，对不起。

03:04.918 --> 03:06.320
[both scream]
[两人尖叫]

03:08.289 --> 03:10.791
- SEE IF IT'S SAFE.
- 看看是否安全。

03:10.791 --> 03:13.861
- AW, THE MOVIE'S OVER.
- 噢，电影结束了。

03:13.861 --> 03:16.730
- AW, DANG,
WE HARDLY EVEN SAW IT.
- 啊，当，
我们几乎没有看到它。

03:16.730 --> 03:18.031
- WELL, WE'LL WATCH IT AGAIN.
- 好吧，我们会再看一遍。

03:18.031 --> 03:20.100
AND THIS TIME,
ALL THE WAY THROUGH.
而这一次，
一路走来。

03:20.100 --> 03:22.370
[bubbling]
[冒泡]

03:22.370 --> 03:25.306
OKAY, KEEP YOUR EYES OPEN.
- NO PROBLEM.
好吧，请睁大眼睛。
- 没问题。

03:25.306 --> 03:27.408
- I LOVE EATING ICE CREAM.
- 我喜欢吃冰淇淋。

03:27.408 --> 03:30.744
- PATRICK, I'M GETTING SCARED.
HOLD MY EYELIDS OPEN.
- 帕特里克，我害怕了。
睁开我的眼皮。

03:30.744 --> 03:32.079
- I'M ON IT.
- 我来了。

03:32.079 --> 03:33.647
- OH!
- 哦！

03:35.783 --> 03:38.286
- HEY, MY ICE CREAM!
- 嘿，我的冰淇淋！

03:38.286 --> 03:41.822
[crying]
[哭泣]

03:41.822 --> 03:44.191
IT WAS ROCKY ROAD!
那是崎岖的道路！

03:44.191 --> 03:47.828
- MUST CLOSE EYES!
TOO SCARY!
- 必须闭上眼睛！
太可怕了！

03:47.828 --> 03:52.132
- UH, I CAN'T HOLD YOUR EYELIDS.
THEY'RE TOO SLIPPERY.
- 呃，我抓不住你的眼皮。
它们太滑了。

03:52.132 --> 03:53.133
OW!
噢！

03:53.133 --> 03:55.002
[both screaming]
[两人尖叫]

03:55.002 --> 03:58.038
[muffled screaming]
[低沉的尖叫声]

03:58.038 --> 03:59.139
- [whistles]
- [口哨]

03:59.139 --> 04:02.075
[screaming]
[尖叫]

04:02.075 --> 04:03.611
- OH, NO,
WE MISSED THE MOVIE.
- 哦，不，
我们错过了这部电影。

04:03.611 --> 04:05.779
- WHAT? NOT AGAIN!
- 什么？不再！

04:05.779 --> 04:07.948
- IT'S OKAY,
WE'LL JUST SEE THE NEXT ONE.
- 没关系，
我们会看到下一个。

04:07.948 --> 04:09.417
- I'M AFRAID NOT.
- 恐怕不是。

04:09.417 --> 04:11.485
THAT WAS THE LAST SHOWING.
那是最后一次放映。

04:11.485 --> 04:12.953
- WOW, WHAT TIME IS IT?
- 哇，现在几点了？

04:12.953 --> 04:15.923
- IT IS ONE MINUTE
TO MIDNIGHT.
- 这是一分钟
到午夜。

04:15.923 --> 04:18.125
- ONE MINUTE TO MIDNIGHT?
- 距离午夜还有一分钟？

04:18.125 --> 04:19.927
- BUT THAT'S WHEN
THE FISHERMAN COMES OUT!
- 但就在那时
渔夫出来了！

04:19.927 --> 04:22.062
- COME ON, PATRICK,
WE GOTTA GET HOME.
- 来吧，帕特里克，
我们得回家了。

04:22.062 --> 04:23.864
both: AAH! THE FISHERMAN!
两人：啊！渔夫！

04:23.864 --> 04:28.502
[both screaming]
[两人尖叫]

04:28.502 --> 04:32.673
[bell tolling]
[钟声响起]

04:36.810 --> 04:40.414
both: IT'S MIDNIGHT!
THE FISHERMAN!
两人：现在是午夜！
渔夫！

04:40.414 --> 04:43.817
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

04:43.817 --> 04:45.619
- WHEW. WE MADE IT.
- 哇。我们做到了。

04:45.619 --> 04:48.789
- I GUESS WE SHOWED THAT
OLD HORROR MOVIE WHO'S BOSS.
- 我想我们已经证明了这一点
老恐怖电影谁是老大。

04:48.789 --> 04:51.659
- YEAH, WE LOOKED FEAR
RIGHT IN THE FACE
- 是的，我们看起来很恐惧
就在眼前

04:51.659 --> 04:53.694
AND AVOIDED
DIRECT EYE CONTACT.
和避免
直接目光接触。

04:53.694 --> 04:55.763
- IT'S LIKE WE'RE HEROES.
- 就像我们是英雄一样。

04:55.763 --> 04:58.532
- OKAY, BUDDY, SLEEP TIGHT.
I'LL SEE YOU TOMORROW.
- 好吧，伙计，睡个好觉。
明天见。

04:58.532 --> 05:01.702
- WAIT A SECOND.
YOU MEAN I GOTTA WALK
- 等一下。
你的意思是我得走路

05:01.702 --> 05:03.571
ALL THE WAY HOME ALONE?
独自一人回家？

05:03.571 --> 05:04.872
- NO. NO, YOU DON'T.
- 不。不，你不。

05:04.872 --> 05:06.073
I'M GONNA WALK YOU
TO YOUR DOOR.
我会陪你散步
到您家门口。

05:06.073 --> 05:08.442
- DARNED OLD HORROR MOVIE.
- 该死的老恐怖电影。

05:08.442 --> 05:11.044
WHY COULDN'T WE WATCH
A CARTOON INSTEAD?
为什么我们不能看
卡通片代替？

05:11.044 --> 05:12.846
[foghorn blows]
YOU HEAR THAT?
[雾号吹响]
你听到了吗？

05:12.846 --> 05:14.548
- [whispers] I THINK
IT'S COMING FROM OVER THERE.
- [低声]我想
它是从那边传来的。

05:14.548 --> 05:17.050
[thunder rumbling]
[雷声隆隆]

05:17.050 --> 05:19.119
both: IT'S THE FISHERMAN!
两人：是渔夫！

05:19.119 --> 05:20.388
[both screaming]
[两人尖叫]

05:24.091 --> 05:27.160
[wheels squeaking]
[车轮吱吱作响]

05:27.160 --> 05:29.397
- OH, IT'S JUST
SLASHER MCGEE.
- 哦，只是这样
砍杀者麦基。

05:29.397 --> 05:31.965
OKAY, I GUESS
I'LL JUST GO HOME NOW.
好吧，我猜
我现在就回家。

05:31.965 --> 05:33.434
IT'S RIGHT OVER THERE.
它就在那里。

05:33.434 --> 05:34.502
MM--
毫米 -

05:34.502 --> 05:36.404
JUST A FEW STEPS
THAT-A-WAY...
只需几个步骤
就这样...

05:36.404 --> 05:39.006
IN THE DARK...
ALL ALONE.
在黑暗中...
独自一人。

05:39.006 --> 05:42.776
- OH, OKAY, COME ON, NOW.
DON'T BE ALL SCARED.
- 哦，好吧，来吧，现在。
不要害怕。

05:42.776 --> 05:43.777
I'LL WALK YOU HOME.
我送你回家。

05:43.777 --> 05:46.179
- AW, THANKS, OLD PAL.
- 噢，谢谢，老朋友。

05:46.179 --> 05:49.550
BUT THEN WHO'S GONNA
WALK YOU HOME?
但接下来谁会
送你回家吗？

05:49.550 --> 05:52.986
- LET'S JUST CROSS THAT BRIDGE
WHEN WE BURN IT.
- 让我们过那座桥吧
当我们燃烧它时。

05:52.986 --> 05:53.987
[foghorn]
[雾号]

05:53.987 --> 05:55.756
both: THE FISHERMAN!
两人：渔夫！

05:55.756 --> 05:59.760
[both screaming]
[两人尖叫]

05:59.760 --> 06:01.429
- [growls]
- [咆哮]

06:01.429 --> 06:02.763
[grumbles]
[抱怨]

06:02.763 --> 06:05.599
[both screaming]
[两人尖叫]

06:05.599 --> 06:08.001
[both panting]
[两人都气喘吁吁]

06:08.001 --> 06:09.937
- WHAT IS WRONG WITH YOU?
[both screaming]
- 你怎么了？
[两人尖叫]

06:09.937 --> 06:12.072
[shuddering]
[颤抖]

06:12.072 --> 06:13.441
- OH, HEY, SQUIDWARD.
- 哦，嘿，章鱼哥。

06:13.441 --> 06:15.776
- WHAT ARE
YOU BLOCKHEADS UP TO?
- 什么是
你还傻吗？

06:15.776 --> 06:17.545
DON'T YOU KNOW
IT'S AFTER MIDNIGHT?
你不知道吗
现在是午夜之后吗？

06:17.545 --> 06:18.879
GET DOWN HERE!
下来！

06:18.879 --> 06:21.248
- WE CAN'T GET HOME.
- WE'RE TOO SCARED.
- 我们无法回家。
- 我们太害怕了。

06:21.248 --> 06:22.783
- [grumbles]
- [抱怨]

06:22.783 --> 06:26.253
- OH, THANK YOU, SQUIDWARD.
YOU'RE A TRUE FRIEND.
-哦，谢谢你，章鱼哥。
你是一个真正的朋友。

06:27.621 --> 06:29.457
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

06:29.457 --> 06:32.460
- THANKS, SQUIDW--
- 谢谢，乌贼--

06:32.460 --> 06:33.761
- YEAH, THANKS, SQUIDWARD.
- 是的，谢谢，章鱼哥。

06:33.761 --> 06:35.863
I DON'T THINK WE WOULD HAVE EVER
GOTTEN HOME WITHOUT YOU.
我认为我们永远不会
回家了，没有你。

06:35.863 --> 06:38.799
- HAT.
- OH, YEAH. HERE.
- 帽子。
- 哦，是的。这里。

06:44.071 --> 06:47.575
- I TOLD THOSE MUTTONHEADS
NOT TO SEE THAT MOVIE.
- 我告诉那些羊头鬼
不是去看那部电影。

06:47.575 --> 06:50.878
- PATRICK!
ARE YOU OKAY?
- 帕特里克！
你还好吗？

06:50.878 --> 06:53.213
- YEAH!
ARE YOU OKAY?
- 是的！
你还好吗？

06:53.213 --> 06:55.282
- I THINK SO!
GOOD NIGHT!
- 我想是的！
晚安！

06:55.282 --> 06:57.551
- YEAH! GOOD NIGHT!
- 是的！晚安！

06:57.551 --> 07:00.087
AND JUST DON'T THINK
ABOUT THE FISHERMAN!
只是不要去想
关于渔夫！

07:00.087 --> 07:04.391
- OH, NO, I WILL NOT THINK
ABOUT THE FISHERMAN!
- 哦，不，我不会想
关于渔夫！

07:04.391 --> 07:05.726
SLEEP TIGHT!
睡个好觉！

07:05.726 --> 07:08.596
- OH, "THE FISHERMAN,"
"THE FISHERMAN."
- 哦，“渔夫”
“渔夫。”

07:08.596 --> 07:09.797
BLAH, BLAH, BLAH.
巴拉，巴拉，巴拉。

07:09.797 --> 07:12.265
THEY WANT A FISHERMAN, EH?
他们想要一个渔夫，嗯？

07:12.265 --> 07:16.504
I'LL GIVE 'EM A FISHERMAN,
AND HOW.
我会给他们一个渔夫，
以及如何。

07:19.640 --> 07:22.042
NO.
不。

07:22.042 --> 07:24.077
NO.
不。

07:24.077 --> 07:25.746
UM...
嗯...

07:25.746 --> 07:28.215
NO.
不。

07:28.215 --> 07:31.652
AHA!
啊哈！

07:31.652 --> 07:35.623
IT'S TIME FOR THOSE LAME-BRAINS
TO MEET THE REAL FISHERMAN.
是时候对付那些笨蛋了
遇见真正的渔夫。

07:39.827 --> 07:44.732
THIS IS GONNA BE GOOD.
[laughs]
这会很好的。
[笑]

07:52.540 --> 07:56.610
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

07:59.246 --> 08:02.816
UH, HELLO?
IS SOMEONE THERE?
呃，你好？
有人在吗？

08:03.951 --> 08:05.753
UH, HUH?
呃，呃？

08:05.753 --> 08:07.688
WHAT'S THAT? WHA--
那是什么？世界卫生大会 -

08:07.688 --> 08:11.559
SOMETHING'S STUCK--
UH, HUH.
有东西卡住了——
呃，呃。

08:11.559 --> 08:16.096
OH. OH, WAIT A SECOND.
OH, YEAH, THAT'S THE SPOT.
哦。哦，等一下。
哦，是的，就是这个地方。

08:16.096 --> 08:17.865
A LITTLE TO THE LEFT.
向左一点。

08:17.865 --> 08:23.170
OH, YEAH! ALL RIGHT.
RIGHT THERE! [laughs]
哦，是啊！好的。
就在那里！ [笑]

08:23.170 --> 08:25.272
- [laughs] GOTCHA!
- [笑]明白了！

08:25.272 --> 08:27.708
- UGH! MM.
- 呃！毫米。

08:27.708 --> 08:31.178
THE FISHERMAN!
[screams]
渔夫！
[尖叫声]

08:31.178 --> 08:33.714
- MAYBE THIS WASN'T
SUCH A GOOD IDEA.
- 也许这不是
真是个好主意。

08:33.714 --> 08:35.649
[screams]
[尖叫声]

08:41.088 --> 08:46.927
- [screams]
- [laughs maniacally]
- [尖叫]
- [疯狂地笑]

08:50.463 --> 08:51.732
[grunts]
[咕哝]

08:51.732 --> 08:52.966
- HMM.
- 唔。

08:52.966 --> 08:54.301
- [laughs maniacally]
- [疯狂地笑]

08:54.301 --> 08:57.671
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

08:57.671 --> 09:01.508
SPONGEBOB! SPONGEBOB, WAKE UP!
HE'S HERE!
海绵宝宝！海绵宝宝，醒醒！
他在这里！

09:01.508 --> 09:04.044
- WHO'S HERE?
HOLD ON, LET ME TURN ON--
- 谁在这里？
等一下，让我打开——

09:04.044 --> 09:06.179
OH, YOUR FACE!
哦，你的脸！

09:06.179 --> 09:08.882
- OH.
- 哦。

09:08.882 --> 09:09.883
THERE.
那里。

09:09.883 --> 09:11.518
- NOW, WHO'S HERE?
- 现在，谁在这里？

09:11.518 --> 09:14.154
- UH, SOMEONE'S HERE?
- YOU JUST SAID.
- 呃，有人在这里吗？
- 你刚才说。

09:14.154 --> 09:16.890
- OH! YEAH.
THE FISHERMAN'S HERE.
- 哦！是的。
渔夫来了。

09:16.890 --> 09:18.158
- THE FISHERMAN!
- 渔夫！

09:18.158 --> 09:19.492
- [babbles]
- [胡言乱语]

09:19.492 --> 09:22.429
[both screaming]
[两人尖叫]

09:22.429 --> 09:24.064
- THE FISHERMAN'S HERE!
- [laughs]
- 渔夫来了！
- [笑]

09:24.064 --> 09:25.365
LISTEN TO THOSE NUDNIKS.
听听那些努德尼克的声音。

09:25.365 --> 09:28.135
WHAT A COUPLE
OF HOPELESS BABIES.
多么一对啊
绝望的婴儿。

09:28.135 --> 09:32.305
I REALLY SHOULD STOP,
BUT I'M HAVING TOO MUCH FUN.
我真的应该停下来，
但我玩得太开心了。

09:32.305 --> 09:35.075
HA, IT'S ALMOST TOO EASY.
哈，这太容易了。

09:35.075 --> 09:36.644
- QUICK! BAR THE DOOR!
- [whimpering]
- 快的！关上门！
- [呜咽]

09:36.644 --> 09:38.779
- THERE'S JUST
NO SPORT IN IT.
- 就这样
没有任何运动。

09:38.779 --> 09:40.848
- IS THAT EVERYTHING?
- WHAT ABOUT THIS?
- 这就是一切吗？
- 这个怎么样？

09:40.848 --> 09:41.849
- NOT GARY!
- 不是加里！

09:41.849 --> 09:45.318
[door handle jiggles]
[门把手抖动]

09:45.318 --> 09:48.989
DO YOU THINK IT'LL HOLD?
- I SURE HOPE SO!
您认为它会持续吗？
- 我当然希望如此！

09:48.989 --> 09:52.092
- [laughs maniacally]
- [疯狂地笑]

09:52.092 --> 09:54.094
[both screaming]
[两人尖叫]

09:54.094 --> 09:56.830
[both grunting]
[两人都咕哝着]

09:56.830 --> 09:58.331
[both scream]
[两人尖叫]

09:58.331 --> 10:01.334
- MAYBE IF WE DON'T LOOK AT HIM,
HE'LL GO AWAY.
- 也许如果我们不看他，
他会走开。

10:01.334 --> 10:02.936
- HEY, YEAH,
JUST LIKE THE MOVIE.
- 嘿，是的，
就像电影一样。

10:02.936 --> 10:05.305
[both straining]
[双方都紧张]

10:08.508 --> 10:12.012
- I'M THE DEADLY FISHERMAN!
- 我是致命的渔夫！

10:12.012 --> 10:14.414
[both screaming]
[两人尖叫]

10:14.414 --> 10:16.149
- I GUESS THIS IS THE END,
OLD BUDDY.
- 我想这就是结局，
老伙计。

10:16.149 --> 10:18.218
- I DON'T WANT TO DIE
IN MY UNDERWEAR!
- 我不想死
在我的内衣里！

10:18.218 --> 10:20.153
- HERE...[grunts]
- 这里...[咕哝]

10:20.153 --> 10:21.722
DIE IN MINE.
死在我的里面。

10:21.722 --> 10:23.824
- HEY, GOOD IDEA.
- 嘿，好主意。

10:23.824 --> 10:26.359
[grunts] LET'S TRADE.
HERE YOU GO.
[咕哝]我们来交易吧。
干得好。

10:26.359 --> 10:28.595
- AND HERE YOU GO.
NOW, WHERE WERE WE?
- 给你。
现在，我们在哪里？

10:28.595 --> 10:29.997
OH, YEAH.
哦，是的。

10:29.997 --> 10:31.198
[both screaming]
[两人尖叫]

10:31.198 --> 10:33.767
both: HE'S GONNA TURN US
INTO FISH STICKS!
两人：他会改变我们
变成鱼条！

10:33.767 --> 10:36.503
- [laughs maniacally]
- [疯狂地笑]

10:36.503 --> 10:40.073
[both gasp, scream]
[两人都喘气，尖叫]

10:40.073 --> 10:43.010
[laughs maniacally]
[疯狂地笑]

10:43.010 --> 10:44.411
- THAT THING'S
EATING SQUIDWARD!
- 那件事是
吃章鱼哥！

10:44.411 --> 10:47.447
- NOT OUR BESTEST BUDDY!
WE'VE GOTTA SAVE HIM!
- 不是我们最好的伙伴！
我们必须救他！

10:48.982 --> 10:52.519
OKAY, PLAY 33.
I NEED YOU TO GO LONG.
好的，开始玩 33。
我需要你坚持下去。

10:52.519 --> 10:54.254
AND...BREAK!
并且...打破！

10:54.254 --> 10:56.757
YOU'RE GOIN' DOWN, FISHERMAN!
你要沉下去了，渔夫！

10:56.757 --> 10:57.758
- [laughs]
- [笑]

10:57.758 --> 10:58.759
HUH?
嗯？

10:58.759 --> 11:00.060
[grunts]
[咕哝]

11:00.060 --> 11:02.763
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

11:02.763 --> 11:03.931
- DON'T WORRY, SQUIDWARD.
- 别担心，章鱼哥。

11:03.931 --> 11:05.298
WE'LL GET YOU OUT
OF THAT OLD MONSTER.
我们会把你救出来
那个老怪物的。

11:05.298 --> 11:06.399
- [groans]
- AH!
- [呻吟]
- 啊！

11:06.399 --> 11:07.868
LET'S ESCAPE
THROUGH THE WINDOW!
让我们逃吧
透过窗户！

11:07.868 --> 11:09.569
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

11:13.473 --> 11:18.411
[both grunting]
[两人都咕哝着]

11:20.547 --> 11:24.251
- OKAY,
I THINK YOU'VE GOT IT!
- 好吧，
我想你已经明白了！

11:24.251 --> 11:25.452
[siren blaring]
[警笛鸣响]

11:25.452 --> 11:28.288
- [grumbling]
- [抱怨]

11:28.288 --> 11:29.757
[angry babbling]
- SHH, SHH, SHH.
[愤怒的胡言乱语]
- 嘘，嘘，嘘。

11:29.757 --> 11:31.925
THERE, THERE.
NO NEED TO THANK US.
那里，那里。
无需感谢我们。

11:31.925 --> 11:33.994
WE WERE ONLY DOING
WHAT ANY GOOD FRIENDS WOULD DO
我们只是在做
好朋友会做什么

11:33.994 --> 11:35.662
FOR THEIR BESTEST BUDDY.
为了他们最好的伙伴。

11:35.662 --> 11:38.665
I GUESS WE DON'T HAVE TO WORRY
ABOUT THAT OLD MONSTER ANYMORE.
我想我们不必担心
关于那个老怪物了。

11:38.665 --> 11:41.068
- [growls]
- [咆哮]

11:41.068 --> 11:43.771
- HUH?
[both screaming]
- 嗯？
[两人尖叫]

11:43.771 --> 11:46.439
[siren blares]
[警笛声]

11:46.439 --> 11:48.375
- MEOW.
- 喵。

11:51.812 --> 11:54.815
[spooky music]
[诡异的音乐]

[诡异的音乐]